{"id": "4594711b-25db-4707-afea-9a7d3949ac9b", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T07:35:15.892349", "source": "agent", "parent_id": "fac7f197-4f1d-4d9c-bf38-c1216910c751", "action": {"stage": "plan", "answer": "## (1) Inspection of available inputs — verbatim findings

